Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:36:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(narration): never leave the player stuck when Mistral
 fails

- Fall back to the scenario's written narration on any Mistral error,
  timeout (10s) or empty reply instead of emitting an ignored error event
- Read text from array-style content chunks, not only string deltas
- Strip wrapping quotes/markdown and cap length at 320 chars
- Client shows a fallback line on error/non-OK/network drop so the
  Continue button always appears
- Force dynamic Node runtime and disable proxy buffering for SSE

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013UNdeRbMfGDu58pPEzk9BC
