From 8cfd7d8e134f04b8421150fa4f927ce132a52e5d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avaneesh Gujran <nishu.gujran@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:52:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(narration): show a toast when Mistral is unavailable

Server emits a narration_unavailable event whenever the Mistral call
fails, times out or returns nothing (not when no key is configured).
The client also raises it on a non-OK response, a stream error or a
network drop. The toast auto-dismisses after 6s and can be closed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013UNdeRbMfGDu58pPEzk9BC
